      "summary": "Parsley, garlic and oregano chimichurri with red wine vinegar and olive oil, rested before serving.",
      "method_md": "**Chimichurri**<br><br>**Ingredients**\n\t- 1 cup flat-leaf parsley, finely chopped<br> 2 cloves garlic, minced<br> 1 tsp dried oregano<br> 2 tbsp red wine vinegar<br> ½ cup extra virgin olive oil<br> ¾ tsp fine sea salt<br> ½ tsp black pepper<br> Pinch chili flakes (optional)\n\t**Method**<br>1. Combine all ingredients in a bowl and stir well.<br>2. Rest 1–2 hours before serving.<br>3. Storage: keeps 3–4 days refrigerated.",
